MODULE: SweepTerminatesResetCursorOnReminder
TARGET: SweepTerminates
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: Repeated reminders rewind a multi-chunk probe indefinitely.
PERTURBS: Reminder
--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, cursor, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
                   repaired, probeOnly, demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump,
                   busy, selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: each reminder loses the accumulated probe prefix.
    /\ cursor' = IF phase = "Probe" THEN 0 ELSE cursor
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
                   repaired, probeOnly, demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump,
                   busy, selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- END
